== Segregate genera ==
The genus ''Paneroa'' consists of one species, ''Paneroa stachyofolia'', native to [[Oaxaca]], which was first described in ''Ageratum'' but which seems to be more closely related to ''[[Conoclinium]]'' and ''[[Fleischmannia]]''.<ref>{{cite journal | doi = 10.3417/2007173 | title = Paneroa, A New Genus of Eupatorieae (Asteraceae) from Mexico | year = 2008 | author = Schilling, Edward E. | journal = Novon: A Journal for Botanical Nomenclature | volume = 18 | issue = 4 | pages = 520–523 | s2cid = 85729667 | url = https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/part/58019 | access-date = 2023-01-21 | archive-date = 2023-11-08 | archive-url = https://web.archive.org/web/20231108142313/https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/part/58019 | url-status = live }}</ref>

